    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760310/extras/e055672d0667c70317fbf2f24e61989b.avif?t=1755024330\" width=616 height=310 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four centuries ago, the world witnessed the Decline of the Gods \u2014 the end of an age where divine forces walked among mortals. At the heart of this cataclysm a creature forged in the depths of primordial Chaos: Draltaksan, an ancient dragon born from absolute darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forged at the dawn of the world, Draltaksan belongs to the oldest of the three tyrant races: the dragons \u2014 beings born of Chaos, in contrast to humans, shaped between light and shadow, and elves, born from pure light. His rise marked the collapse of harmony among peoples and the fall of the deities that once protected the balance of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through an unprecedented sacrifice, the threat was contained \u2014 but never destroyed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, in a new era of apparent prosperity, the world begins to crack once more. Forgotten signs return. Whispers echo through ancient ruins. Silent cults invoke names long erased from the memory of mankind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amid this rising tide of darkness, a young man marked by the past is summoned to the royal capital of Aetheria. His calling is not merely the beginning of a journey, but the rise of a fragile hope in the face of the first shadows threatening to descend upon the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760310/extras/6fba0b7e0d0f0edf4ed7c22e2accd3e3.avif?t=1755024330\" width=616 height=177 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oleg</strong> \u2013 Rogue</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760310/extras/a5353b8b04f2a3d621697a6f35f67498.avif?t=1755024330\" width=386 height=386 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A shadow warrior marked by the scars of his past. A survivor of a tragedy that devastated his homeland, Oleg is summoned to the heart of Aetheria to answer a higher calling. Quiet yet resolute, he carries in his eyes the promise of vengeance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alexander</strong> \u2013 Paladin</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760310/extras/194ee62c0a0cfd01150c63b0b0c31194.avif?t=1755024330\" width=386 height=386 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Captain of the northern infantry and member of the sacred Order of Paladins of Aetheria. Alexander embodies honor, loyalty, and unwavering faith in the ideals of the kingdom. A defender of balance and justice, he leads with sword in hand and a pure heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Balthazar</strong> \u2013 Mage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760310/extras/72304beb999c0ceaf1eaf09d77ce4348.avif?t=1755024330\" width=386 height=386 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An arcane scholar from Velffanor, assigned to a secret mission of great importance: to investigate the whereabouts of a former mage who deserted the Arcane Council and was exiled after delving into necromancy \u2014 a forbidden art since the Decline of the Gods. Intelligent and calculating, Balthazar understands the dangers of tampering with the fabric of reality \u2014 and knows that time is not on their side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Katherine</strong> \u2013 Priestess</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760310/extras/f0fbca8a9feed819d945ea6fe7f98cce.avif?t=1755024330\" width=386 height=386 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daughter of the Lord of Ambrosia, Katherine is a priestess of light admired for her compassionate heart and vast command of white magic. Her spirit is a beacon in dark times, guiding her allies with wisdom and empathy even when facing the abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sigfra</strong> \u2013 Huntress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760310/extras/ed11e428e0d35c7d0f32b830c9e8b4dc.avif?t=1755024330\" width=386 height=386 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An elven master archer and member of the Alskatel Sentinel \u2014 the elite force charged with guarding the elven borders. Watchful and pragmatic, Sigfra patrols the shadows of the Dark Forest, where danger hides among the branches and only the keenest eyes survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leora</strong> \u2013 Monk</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760310/extras/e014bfd03b4edda83de86b7a94d99527.avif?t=1755024330\" width=386 height=386 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Champion of the Floating Isles of Drakhal, a sacred land south of Alskatel. Forged through rites of absolute discipline, Leora masters an ancient spiritual path that unites body, mind, and magical essence. Her mission is sacred: to uphold the seal that prevents the spread of the ancient curse known as Black Ice \u2014 a duty that demands strength, sacrifice, and unwavering conviction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760310/extras/e055672d0667c70317fbf2f24e61989b.avif?t=1755024330\" width=616 height=310 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four centuries ago, the world witnessed the Decline of the Gods \u2014 the end of an age where divine forces walked among mortals. At the heart of this cataclysm a creature forged in the depths of primordial Chaos: Draltaksan, an ancient dragon born from absolute darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forged at the dawn of the world, Draltaksan belongs to the oldest of the three tyrant races: the dragons \u2014 beings born of Chaos, in contrast to humans, shaped between light and shadow, and elves, born from pure light. His rise marked the collapse of harmony among peoples and the fall of the deities that once protected the balance of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through an unprecedented sacrifice, the threat was contained \u2014 but never destroyed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, in a new era of apparent prosperity, the world begins to crack once more. Forgotten signs return. Whispers echo through ancient ruins. Silent cults invoke names long erased from the memory of mankind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amid this rising tide of darkness, a young man marked by the past is summoned to the royal capital of Aetheria. His calling is not merely the beginning of a journey, but the rise of a fragile hope in the face of the first shadows threatening to descend upon the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760310/extras/6fba0b7e0d0f0edf4ed7c22e2accd3e3.avif?t=1755024330\" width=616 height=177 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oleg</strong> \u2013 Rogue</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760310/extras/a5353b8b04f2a3d621697a6f35f67498.avif?t=1755024330\" width=386 height=386 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A shadow warrior marked by the scars of his past. A survivor of a tragedy that devastated his homeland, Oleg is summoned to the heart of Aetheria to answer a higher calling. Quiet yet resolute, he carries in his eyes the promise of vengeance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alexander</strong> \u2013 Paladin</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760310/extras/194ee62c0a0cfd01150c63b0b0c31194.avif?t=1755024330\" width=386 height=386 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Captain of the northern infantry and member of the sacred Order of Paladins of Aetheria. Alexander embodies honor, loyalty, and unwavering faith in the ideals of the kingdom. A defender of balance and justice, he leads with sword in hand and a pure heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Balthazar</strong> \u2013 Mage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760310/extras/72304beb999c0ceaf1eaf09d77ce4348.avif?t=1755024330\" width=386 height=386 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An arcane scholar from Velffanor, assigned to a secret mission of great importance: to investigate the whereabouts of a former mage who deserted the Arcane Council and was exiled after delving into necromancy \u2014 a forbidden art since the Decline of the Gods. Intelligent and calculating, Balthazar understands the dangers of tampering with the fabric of reality \u2014 and knows that time is not on their side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Katherine</strong> \u2013 Priestess</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760310/extras/f0fbca8a9feed819d945ea6fe7f98cce.avif?t=1755024330\" width=386 height=386 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daughter of the Lord of Ambrosia, Katherine is a priestess of light admired for her compassionate heart and vast command of white magic. Her spirit is a beacon in dark times, guiding her allies with wisdom and empathy even when facing the abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sigfra</strong> \u2013 Huntress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760310/extras/ed11e428e0d35c7d0f32b830c9e8b4dc.avif?t=1755024330\" width=386 height=386 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An elven master archer and member of the Alskatel Sentinel \u2014 the elite force charged with guarding the elven borders. Watchful and pragmatic, Sigfra patrols the shadows of the Dark Forest, where danger hides among the branches and only the keenest eyes survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leora</strong> \u2013 Monk</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760310/extras/e014bfd03b4edda83de86b7a94d99527.avif?t=1755024330\" width=386 height=386 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Champion of the Floating Isles of Drakhal, a sacred land south of Alskatel. Forged through rites of absolute discipline, Leora masters an ancient spiritual path that unites body, mind, and magical essence. Her mission is sacred: to uphold the seal that prevents the spread of the ancient curse known as Black Ice \u2014 a duty that demands strength, sacrifice, and unwavering conviction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Lead the resistance against an ancient dark order that seeks to awaken an ancient evil and plunge Gaia into chaos. Explore a vast steampunk fantasy world and face formidable opponents in this action RPG, featuring real-time character switching and dynamic combat.",
