        "notes": "This game contains mild 2D violence. Combat generally does not include realistic blood or gore. Some abilities feature stylized visual effects with dark tones, but do not directly depict blood.\r\nThe story explores themes of crime, political corruption, and assassination, with dead soldier bodies visible in the environment, but without graphic detail.\r\nLanguage includes occasional strong or aggressive expressions between characters (e.g., \"bastard,\" \"damn you,\" \"I'll kill you\").\r\nThere is no nudity or sexual content.\r\nCertain scenes and specific enemies may involve more direct use of blood, especially in fantasy or supernatural contexts, though never portrayed with extreme realism or explicit gore."
